<title>UK: UK OFT seeks comment on Amersham, Pharmacia.</title>
<headline>UK OFT seeks comment on Amersham, Pharmacia.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Office of Fair Trading (OFT) said on Friday it was seeking comments from interested parties on the proposed merger between Amersham International Plc's life sciences division and Sweden's Pharmacia Biotech, owned by Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn Inc.</p>
</text>
